It contains data from other projects, each under its own terms:

- corpus/ledgers/pubnet: LedgerCloseMeta objects copied byte for byte from
  SDF's public Stellar data lake (AWS Open Data,
  s3://aws-public-blockchain/v1.1/stellar/ledgers/pubnet). Stellar ledger
  data is public network data.
- corpus/ledgers/testnet: LedgerCloseMeta served by Stellar RPC
  (https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org).
- corpus/ledgers/local: produced by stellar-core 30.0.0 (Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/stellar/stellar-core) running the scenarios in
  kit/capture.
- stellar-core's --check-lcm golden files are downloaded at test time from
  https://github.com/stellar/stellar-core (Apache-2.0) and are not
  redistributed here.
